sequenceDiagram
  actor P as Parent
  participant API as ImagesService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as ai queue
  participant WK as AI Worker
  participant AI as AI Service (FLUX.2 klein)
  P->>API: POST /stories/:id/images
  API->>DB: check private story, not generating, AI not blocked
  API->>DB: portraits missing for story characters -> ai_requests(character_portrait) + holdCredit
  API->>DB: scenes without image (max 4) -> ai_requests(scene_image) + holdCredit
  alt not enough credit
    API-->>P: 402 Not enough credit
  end
  API->>Q: enqueue portraits, scenes waiting for portrait stay queued
  API-->>P: {portraits, scenes, waiting}
  Q->>WK: portrait job
  WK->>AI: POST /v1/images/portrait (appearance only, no real name)
  AI-->>WK: image key (uploaded to Cloudinary)
  WK->>DB: persistImageResult, consumeCredit
  WK->>API: resumeAfterPortrait -> enqueue waiting scenes
  Q->>WK: scene job
  WK->>AI: POST /v1/images/scene (scene description + portrait references)
  WK->>DB: scene imageStatus=ready, consumeCredit
